# App IDs synced onto every YaguareteOS system by yaguarete-flatpak-sync,
# one per line. Keep this in sync with flatpaks/*/card.y*ml's flatpak.id
# whenever a card is added to YaguareteOS.yml's flatpaks: list.
#
# org.yaguarete.Steam is intentionally NOT here: it goes through its own
# first-boot setup screen (anaconda-webui), which owns when it gets
# installed instead of a silent background sync.
org.yaguarete.ArchiveManager
org.yaguarete.DiskUsageAnalyzer
org.yaguarete.ImageViewer
org.yaguarete.TextEditor
org.yaguarete.Calculator
org.yaguarete.DocumentViewer
org.yaguarete.QwenCodeDesktop
